{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782088339645,"sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-afbf471282ec5f26","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.csproj"},"output":"<path>/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.csproj</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: <Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n2: \n3:   <PropertyGroup>\n4:     <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>\n5:     <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n6:     <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n7:   </PropertyGroup>\n8: \n9: </Project>\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n\n  <PropertyGroup>\n    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>\n    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n  </PropertyGroup>\n\n</Project>","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.csproj","text":"<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n\n  <PropertyGroup>\n    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>\n    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n  </PropertyGroup>\n\n</Project>","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.csproj","time":{"start":1782088339639,"end":1782088339644}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Good. Namespaces:\n- `ModelContextProtocol.Server.McpServerToolAttribute`\n- `ModelContextProtocol.Server.McpServerToolTypeAttribute`\n- `Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.McpServerBuilderExtensions`\n- `Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.McpServerServiceCollectionExtensions`\n\nAlso need `Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting`. The ModelContextProtocol package likely depends on hosting extensions. Let me also add `Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting` to the Server project to use Host.CreateApplicationBuilder. Actually the MCP package probably pulls it transitively. Let me add it explicitly to be safe.\n\nLet me check parameter handling: For tool methods, parameters get discovered by name and become tool input schema. The return type can be a string or serializable object. The simplest approach: return `string` (markdown/plain text) which becomes a CallToolResult text content.\n\nNow let me design the Core library files:\n\nFiles in Core:\n- `Models/Match.cs` — unified match record + Competition enum\n- `Models/Player.cs` — FIFA player record\n- `Models/TeamStats.cs` — stats result\n- `Models/HeadToHead.cs`\n- `Models/MatchFilter.cs`\n- `Data/Competition.cs` (enum)\n- `Data/TeamNameNormalizer.cs`\n- `Data/DateParser.cs`\n- `Data/Csv/CsvReader.cs` — simple CSV parser\n- `Data/MatchDataLoader.cs` — loads all 5 match CSVs into unified Match list\n- `Data/PlayerDataLoader.cs` — loads fifa_data.csv\n- `Services/SoccerQueryService.cs` — all query methods\n- `BrazilianSoccerData.cs` — facade combining loaders + service\n\nLet me start writing. I'll keep it focused but complete.\n\nFirst, let me look at the data files more carefully to get column exact names and types.\n\nBrasileirao_Matches.csv: datetime,home_team,home_team_state,away_team,away_team_state,home_goal,away_goal,season,round\n  - home_goal/away_goal are integers (no quotes)\n  - season integer\n  - round integer\n\nBrazilian_Cup_Matches.csv: round,datetime,home_team,away_team,home_goal,away_goal,season\n  - round quoted \"1\"\n  - datetime \"2012-03-07 16:00:00\"\n  - home_team/away_team quoted\n  - home_goal/away_goal integers\n  - season integer\n\nLibertadores_Matches.csv: datetime,home_team,away_team,home_goal,away_goal,season,stage\n  - home_goal/away_goal quoted \"2\"\n  - season integer\n  - stage quoted\n\nBR-Football-Dataset.csv: tournament,home,home_goal,away_goal,away,home_corner,away_corner,home_attack,away_attack,home_shots,away_shots,time,date,ht_diff,at_diff,ht_result,at_result,total_corners\n  - all unquoted\n  - home_goal/away_goal floats \"1.0\"\n  - date \"2023-09-24\"\n  - time \"20:00:00\"\n\nnovo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv: ID,Data,Ano,Rodada,Equipe_mandante,Equipe_visitante,Gols_mandante,Gols_visitante,Mandante_UF,Visitante_UF,Vencedor,Arena,OBS\n  - Data \"29/03/2003\"\n  - Ano int\n  - Vencedor: Mandante/Visitante/Empate\n\nfifa_data.csv: starts with an unnamed index column, then ID,Name,Age,Photo,Nationality,Flag,Overall,Potential,Club,Club Logo,Value,Wage,Special,Preferred Foot,International Reputation,Weak Foot,Skill Moves,Work Rate,Body Type,Real Face,Position,Jersey Number,Joined,Loaned From,Contract Valid Until,Height,Weight, ... lots of skill ratings ..., Release Clause\n\nI'll capture the key columns and selected skill columns.\n\nNow let me write all the code. I'll batch the writes.\n\nLet me start with the Core csproj (already created by template). Let me check its content.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecbe0e6c00111pLaz1sJJNzWF","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecbdca1e001TWrjJCPcm3r4lP"}}
