{"type":"text","timestamp":1782088456778,"sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","part":{"id":"prt_eecbf579c001njPUeO0YCuQWUj","messageID":"msg_eecbf38ec001AZhbnN3eyNk9tm","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","type":"text","text":"Now the main query service.","time":{"start":1782088423324,"end":1782088456777}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782088456781,"sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9ce5a87161317fc3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"// BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core - Query service.\n// The single entry point for all MCP tools. It indexes all loaded matches and\n// players by normalized team key and exposes match, team, player, competition\n// and statistical queries. Filtering is normalization-aware so \"Palmeiras\",\n// \"Palmeiras-SP\" and \"palmeiras\" all resolve to the same team.\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.Models;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.Services;\n\n/// <summary>\n/// Provides the query surface used by the MCP tools: match lookups, team\n/// statistics, head-to-head comparisons, standings, player searches and\n//  aggregate statistics across all loaded datasets.\n/// </summary>\npublic sealed class SoccerQueryService\n{\n    private readonly IReadOnlyList<Match> _matches;\n    private readonly IReadOnlyList<Player> _players;\n    private readonly Dictionary<string, string> _teamDisplay; // key -> display\n    private readonly Dictionary<string, List<Match>> _byTeam; // key -> matches\n\n    public SoccerQueryService(IReadOnlyList<Match> matches, IReadOnlyList<Player> players)\n    {\n        _matches = matches;\n        _players = players;\n        _teamDisplay = new Dictionary<string, string>(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n        _byTeam = new Dictionary<string, List<Match>>(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n\n        foreach (var m in matches)\n        {\n            IndexTeam(m.HomeTeam, m);\n            IndexTeam(m.AwayTeam, m);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<Match> AllMatches => _matches;\n    public IReadOnlyList<Player> AllPlayers => _players;\n    public IEnumerable<string> KnownTeams => _teamDisplay.Values;\n\n    private void IndexTeam(string rawName, Match m)\n    {\n        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(rawName)) return;\n        var key = TeamNameKey(rawName);\n        if (key.Length == 0) return;\n        if (!_byTeam.TryGetValue(key, out var list))\n        {\n            list = new List<Match>();\n            _byTeam[key] = list;\n        }\n        list.Add(m);\n\n        var display = TeamNameDisplay(rawName);\n        // Prefer the shortest, suffix-free display name (i.e. the bare name).\n        if (!_teamDisplay.TryGetValue(key, out var existing) ||\n            display.Length < existing.Length)\n        {\n            _teamDisplay[key] = display;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Delegates to Data.TeamNameNormalizer via injected helpers (kept local to\n    // avoid a static using clutter; the normalizer is stateless).\n    private static string TeamNameKey(string raw) => Data.TeamNameNormalizer.Key(raw);\n    private static string TeamNameDisplay(string raw) => Data.TeamNameNormalizer.DisplayName(raw);\n\n    /// <summary>Resolves a user-supplied team name to its canonical display name.</summary>\n    public string ResolveTeam(string teamName)\n    {\n        var key = TeamNameKey(teamName);\n        return _teamDisplay.TryGetValue(key, out var display) ? display\n             : TeamNameDisplay(teamName);\n    }\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Match queries\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    /// <summary>All matches for a team, optionally filtered by competition/season/date.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<Match> FindMatchesByTeam(\n        string teamName,\n        Competition? competition = null,\n        int? season = null,\n        DateTime? from = null,\n        DateTime? to = null)\n    {\n        var key = TeamNameKey(teamName);\n        if (!_byTeam.TryGetValue(key, out var list)) return Array.Empty<Match>();\n        return list.Where(m => PassesFilters(m, competition, season, from, to))\n                   .OrderBy(m => m.Date)\n                   .ToList();\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>Matches between two teams (either side can be home/away).</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<Match> FindMatchesBetweenTeams(\n        string teamA, string teamB,\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null)\n    {\n        var keyA = TeamNameKey(teamA);\n        var keyB = TeamNameKey(teamB);\n        return _matches.Where(m =>\n            {\n                var h = TeamNameKey(m.HomeTeam);\n                var a = TeamNameKey(m.AwayTeam);\n                bool pair = (h == keyA && a == keyB) || (h == keyB && a == keyA);\n                return pair && PassesFilters(m, competition, season);\n            })\n            .OrderBy(m => m.Date)\n            .ToList();\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>The most recent match between two teams (or null).</summary>\n    public Match? FindMostRecentMatch(string teamA, string teamB)\n        => FindMatchesBetweenTeams(teamA, teamB).MaxBy(m => m.Date);\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Team statistics\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    public TeamStats GetTeamStats(\n        string teamName,\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null)\n    {\n        var key = TeamNameKey(teamName);\n        var matches = FindMatchesByTeam(teamName, competition, season);\n        int w = 0, d = 0, l = 0, gf = 0, ga = 0;\n        int hw = 0, hd = 0, hl = 0, aw = 0, ad = 0, al = 0;\n        foreach (var m in matches)\n        {\n            bool isHome = TeamNameKey(m.HomeTeam) == key;\n            int forGoals = isHome ? m.HomeGoal : m.AwayGoal;\n            int against = isHome ? m.AwayGoal : m.HomeGoal;\n            gf += forGoals; ga += against;\n            if (forGoals > against) { w++; if (isHome) hw++; else aw++; }\n            else if (forGoals == against) { d++; if (isHome) hd++; else ad++; }\n            else { l++; if (isHome) hl++; else al++; }\n        }\n        return new TeamStats\n        {\n            Team = ResolveTeam(teamName),\n            Matches = matches.Count,\n            Wins = w, Draws = d, Losses = l,\n            GoalsFor = gf, GoalsAgainst = ga,\n            HomeMatches = hw + hd + hl, HomeWins = hw, HomeDraws = hd, HomeLosses = hl,\n            AwayMatches = aw + ad + al, AwayWins = aw, AwayDraws = ad, AwayLosses = al,\n            Points = w * 3 + d\n        };\n    }\n\n    public HeadToHead GetHeadToHead(string teamA, string teamB)\n    {\n        var keyA = TeamNameKey(teamA);\n        var keyB = TeamNameKey(teamB);\n        var matches = FindMatchesBetweenTeams(teamA, teamB);\n        int aw = 0, bw = 0, dr = 0;\n        foreach (var m in matches)\n        {\n            bool aHome = TeamNameKey(m.HomeTeam) == keyA;\n            int aGoals = aHome ? m.HomeGoal : m.AwayGoal;\n            int bGoals = aHome ? m.AwayGoal : m.HomeGoal;\n            if (aGoals > bGoals) aw++;\n            else if (aGoals < bGoals) bw++;\n            else dr++;\n        }\n        return new HeadToHead\n        {\n            TeamA = ResolveTeam(teamA),\n            TeamB = ResolveTeam(teamB),\n            TeamAWins = aw, TeamBWins = bw, Draws = dr,\n            Matches = matches.Count,\n            MatchesList = matches\n        };\n    }\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Competition / standings\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    public IEnumerable<int> AvailableSeasons(Competition? competition = null) =>\n        _matches.Where(m => competition == null || m.Competition == competition)\n                .Select(m => m.Season).Distinct().OrderBy(s => s);\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// Calculates a standings table for a season from match results.\n    /// Uses 3 points for a win, 1 for a draw. Tie-breakers: points, goal\n    /// difference, goals for, then name.\n    /// </summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<StandingsRow> GetStandings(int season, Competition competition)\n    {\n        var seasonMatches = _matches.Where(m => m.Season == season && m.Competition == competition).ToList();\n        var table = new Dictionary<string, StandingsAcc>(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n        foreach (var m in seasonMatches)\n        {\n            Acc(table, m.HomeTeam, m.HomeGoal, m.AwayGoal, true);\n            Acc(table, m.AwayTeam, m.AwayGoal, m.HomeGoal, false);\n        }\n        var rows = table.Select(kv =>\n        {\n            var a = kv.Value;\n            return new StandingsRow\n            {\n                Team = ResolveTeam(kv.Key),\n                Played = a.Played, Wins = a.Wins, Draws = a.Draws, Losses = a.Losses,\n                GoalsFor = a.GoalsFor, GoalsAgainst = a.GoalsAgainst,\n                Points = a.Wins * 3 + a.Draws\n            };\n        })\n        .OrderByDescending(r => r.Points)\n        .ThenByDescending(r => r.GoalDifference)\n        .ThenByDescending(r => r.GoalsFor)\n        .ThenBy(r => r.Team)\n        .Select((r, i) => r with { Position = i + 1 })\n        .ToList();\n\n        if (rows.Count > 0)\n            rows[0] = rows[0] with { Champion = true };\n        return rows;\n    }\n\n    private void Acc(Dictionary<string, StandingsAcc> table, string team, int gf, int ga, bool home)\n    {\n        var key = TeamNameKey(team);\n        if (key.Length == 0) return;\n        if (!table.TryGetValue(key, out var acc))\n        {\n            acc = new StandingsAcc();\n            table[key] = acc;\n        }\n        acc.Played++;\n        acc.GoalsFor += gf; acc.GoalsAgainst += ga;\n        if (gf > ga) acc.Wins++;\n        else if (gf == ga) acc.Draws++;\n        else acc.Losses++;\n    }\n\n    private sealed class StandingsAcc\n    {\n        public int Played, Wins, Draws, Losses, GoalsFor, GoalsAgainst;\n    }\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Statistical analysis\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    public double AverageGoalsPerMatch(Competition? competition = null, int? season = null)\n    {\n        var subset = _matches.Where(m => PassesFilters(m, competition, season)).ToList();\n        if (subset.Count == 0) return 0;\n        return (double)subset.Sum(m => m.HomeGoal + m.AwayGoal) / subset.Count;\n    }\n\n    public (double HomeWinRate, double DrawRate, double AwayWinRate) WinRateBreakdown(\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null)\n    {\n        var subset = _matches.Where(m => PassesFilters(m, competition, season)).ToList();\n        if (subset.Count == 0) return (0, 0, 0);\n        int hw = subset.Count(m => m.HomeGoal > m.AwayGoal);\n        int dr = subset.Count(m => m.HomeGoal == m.AwayGoal);\n        int aw = subset.Count(m => m.HomeGoal < m.AwayGoal);\n        double n = subset.Count;\n        return (hw / n, dr / n, aw / n);\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>Top N biggest victories by goal difference.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<Match> BiggestWins(\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null, int top = 10)\n        => _matches.Where(m => PassesFilters(m, competition, season))\n                   .OrderByDescending(m => m.GoalDifference)\n                   .ThenByDescending(m => m.HomeGoal + m.AwayGoal)\n                   .Take(top)\n                   .ToList();\n\n    /// <summary>Best away record by win rate among teams with >= minMatches away games.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<TeamStats> BestAwayRecords(\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null, int minMatches = 10)\n        => _teamDisplay.Keys\n            .Select(k => GetTeamStats(_teamDisplay[k], competition, season))\n            .Where(s => s.AwayMatches >= minMatches)\n            .OrderByDescending(s => s.AwayWinRate)\n            .ThenByDescending(s => s.AwayWins)\n            .ToList();\n\n    /// <summary>Best home record by win rate among teams with >= minMatches home games.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<TeamStats> BestHomeRecords(\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null, int minMatches = 10)\n        => _teamDisplay.Keys\n            .Select(k => GetTeamStats(_teamDisplay[k], competition, season))\n            .Where(s => s.HomeMatches >= minMatches)\n            .OrderByDescending(s => s.HomeWinRate)\n            .ThenByDescending(s => s.HomeWins)\n            .ToList();\n\n    /// <summary>Highest scoring team by total goals in a season/competition.</summary>\n    public TeamStats? TopScoringTeam(\n        Competition? competition = null, int? season = null)\n        => _teamDisplay.Keys\n            .Select(k => GetTeamStats(_teamDisplay[k], competition, season))\n            .OrderByDescending(s => s.GoalsFor)\n            .FirstOrDefault();\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Player queries\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<Player> FindPlayers(\n        string? name = null,\n        string? nationality = null,\n        string? club = null,\n        string? position = null,\n        int? minOverall = null,\n        int? maxOverall = null,\n        int? top = null)\n    {\n        var q = _players.AsEnumerable();\n        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n        {\n            var nm = name.Trim();\n            q = q.Where(p => p.Name.Contains(nm, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));\n        }\n        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(nationality))\n            q = q.Where(p => p.Nationality.Equals(nationality, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));\n        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(club))\n        {\n            var c = club.Trim();\n            q = q.Where(p => p.Club.Contains(c, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));\n        }\n        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(position))\n            q = q.Where(p => p.Position.Equals(position, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));\n        if (minOverall.HasValue) q = q.Where(p => p.Overall >= minOverall.Value);\n        if (maxOverall.HasValue) q = q.Where(p => p.Overall <= maxOverall.Value);\n        q = q.OrderByDescending(p => p.Overall);\n        if (top.HasValue) q = q.Take(top.Value);\n        return q.ToList();\n    }\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<Player> TopBrazilianPlayers(int top = 10)\n        => _players.Where(p => p.IsBrazilian)\n                   .OrderByDescending(p => p.Overall)\n                   .Take(top)\n                   .ToList();\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<Player> PlayersAtClub(string club, int? top = null)\n        => FindPlayers(club: club, top: top);\n\n    /// <summary>\n    /// Brazilian players grouped by Brazilian club, sorted by roster size.\n    /// A \"Brazilian club\" is any club whose name matches a team present in the\n    /// match datasets (so we only report clubs we actually have match data for).\n    /// </summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<(string Club, int Count, double AvgRating)> BrazilianPlayersAtBrazilianClubs()\n    {\n        var clubKeys = new HashSet<string>(_teamDisplay.Keys, StringComparer.Ordinal);\n        return _players\n            .Where(p => p.IsBrazilian && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(p.Club))\n            .GroupBy(p => p.Club)\n            .Where(g => clubKeys.Contains(TeamNameKey(g.Key)))\n            .Select(g => (Club: g.Key, Count: g.Count(), AvgRating: g.Average(p => p.Overall)))\n            .OrderByDescending(t => t.Count)\n            .ToList();\n    }\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Derbies\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    private static readonly (string A, string B)[] DerbyRivals =\n    {\n        (\"Flamengo\",\"Fluminense\"),     // Fla-Flu\n        (\"Flamengo\",\"Vasco\"),          // Clássico dos Milhões\n        (\"Corinthians\",\"Palmeiras\"),   // Majestoso\n        (\"Corinthians\",\"São Paulo\"),   // Majestoso\n        (\"Palmeiras\",\"São Paulo\"),     // Choque Rei\n        (\"Santos\",\"São Paulo\"),\n        (\"Santos\",\"Corinthians\"),\n        (\"Grêmio\",\"Internacional\"),    // Grenal\n        (\"Atlético-MG\",\"Cruzeiro\"),    // Clássico Mineiro\n        (\"Cruzeiro\",\"Atlético Mineiro\"),\n        (\"Bahia\",\"Vitória\"),\n        (\"Fortaleza\",\"Ceará\"),\n        (\"Sport\",\"Náutico\"),\n        (\"Coritiba\",\"Athletico-PR\"),\n        (\"Internacional\",\"Grêmio\")\n    };\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<Match> FindDerbies(int? season = null, Competition? competition = null)\n    {\n        var rivalKeys = DerbyRivals\n            .Select(p => (A: TeamNameKey(p.A), B: TeamNameKey(p.B)))\n            .Where(p => p.A.Length > 0 && p.B.Length > 0)\n            .ToHashSet();\n\n        bool IsDerby(Match m)\n        {\n            var h = TeamNameKey(m.HomeTeam);\n            var a = TeamNameKey(m.AwayTeam);\n            return rivalKeys.Contains((h, a));\n        }\n\n        return _matches.Where(m => PassesFilters(m, competition, season) && IsDerby(m))\n                       .OrderBy(m => m.Date)\n                       .ToList();\n    }\n\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    // Helpers\n    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    private static bool PassesFilters(Match m, Competition? competition, int? season = null,\n        DateTime? from = null, DateTime? to = null)\n    {\n        if (competition.HasValue && m.Competition != competition.Value) return false;\n        if (season.HasValue && m.Season != season.Value) return false;\n        if (from.HasValue && m.Date < from.Value) return false;\n        if (to.HasValue && m.Date > to.Value) return false;\n        return true;\n    }\n}\n","filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/Services/SoccerQueryService.cs"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/Services/SoccerQueryService.cs","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"src/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core/Services/SoccerQueryService.cs","time":{"start":1782088456770,"end":1782088456779}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now the main query service. Let me think about what methods it needs.\n\nIt will operate on a normalized index. Pre-compute a team-key -> display name map and an index of matches by team key, by season etc.\n\nMethods:\n- FindMatchesByTeam(teamName, competition?, season?, from?, to?)\n- FindMatchesBetweenTeams(teamA, teamB, competition?, season?)\n- FindMostRecentMatch(teamA, teamB)\n- GetTeamStats(teamName, season?, competition?)\n- GetHeadToHead(teamA, teamB)\n- GetStandings(season, competition)\n- GetBiggestWins(competition?, season?, top)\n- AverageGoalsPerMatch(competition?, season?)\n- HomeAwayWinRates(competition?, season?)\n- FindPlayers(name?, nationality?, club?, position?, minOverall?, top?)\n- GetTopBrazilianPlayers(top)\n- GetPlayersAtClub(club)\n- FindDerbies(season?, competition?) - using a known derby map\n- BiggestVictories (alias of GetBiggestWins)\n\nLet me also provide a method listing available seasons and competitions.\n\nFor derby detection, I'll hardcode a few traditional rivalries: Fla-Flu (Flamengo, Fluminense), Paulista (Corinthians, Palmeiras, São Paulo, Santos), Grenal (Grêmio, Internacional), Atletico-MG vs Cruzeiro, etc. I'll keep a list of known derby pairs by normalized team keys.\n\nFor team display name normalization: when building the index, I'll map normalized key -> the display name. But the same team may appear with different display names across files. I'll pick the shortest \"clean\" display name (or the first encountered). Better: keep a list of known display names and pick the one without state suffix and shortest. Actually let me just use the display name from the user's query if it matches, otherwise the first encountered display name.\n\nActually for stats, when filtering by team, I match on the normalized key. For display, I want a nice name. Let me build a dictionary: key -> preferred display name. Preferred = the most common display name, or shortest.\n\nLet me implement a helper.\n\nLet me write the query service now.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecbf57b7001Ub1DNPFEGgdujq","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecbf38ec001AZhbnN3eyNk9tm"}}
