et me add `using BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.Data;`.\n\nSimilarly ResponseFormatter uses `CompetitionDisplay` and `Competition` — needs `using BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.Data;`. Let me add it. And `MatchDataLoader` already has `using BrazilianSoccerMcp.Core.Data.Csv;` but it's in the Data namespace itself so `Competition` is fine there.\n\nLet me fix the usings in SoccerQueryService and ResponseFormatter.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecc04b43001OBe61TLgGAaEdx","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecc0339d001SmjyLudRzlnbfD"}}
