{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782088910524,"sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-89df49207a3c8024","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -E 'M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions\\.(RunScenario|AddSteps)' /Users/maui/.nuget/packages/lightbdd.framework/3.12.0/lib/net6.0/LightBDD.Framework.xml","description":"Check RunScenario signatures"},"output":"        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.AddSteps(LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.IScenarioBuilder{LightBDD.Framework.NoContext},System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.AddSteps(LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.ICompositeStepBuilder{LightBDD.Framework.NoContext},System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.RunScenario(LightBDD.Framework.IBddRunner,System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.RunScenarioAsync(LightBDD.Framework.IBddRunner,System.Func{System.Threading.Tasks.Task}[])\">\r\n","metadata":{"output":"        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.AddSteps(LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.IScenarioBuilder{LightBDD.Framework.NoContext},System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.AddSteps(LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.ICompositeStepBuilder{LightBDD.Framework.NoContext},System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.RunScenario(LightBDD.Framework.IBddRunner,System.Action[])\">\r\n        <member name=\"M:LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios.BasicExtensions.RunScenarioAsync(LightBDD.Framework.IBddRunner,System.Func{System.Threading.Tasks.Task}[])\">\r\n","exit":0,"description":"Check RunScenario signatures","truncated":false},"title":"Check RunScenario signatures","time":{"start":1782088910522,"end":1782088910523}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Good. The LightBDD.XUnit2 API:\n- Class derives from `LightBDD.XUnit2.FeatureFixture` (or use `[FeatureFixture]` attribute on class).\n- Has `[Scenario]` methods.\n- Uses `Runner` property (`IBddRunner`).\n- The compact API: `Runner.AddStep(\"GIVEN ...\", ctx => ...).Run();` or `AddSteps`. Actually `CompactExtensions.AddStep<T>(IScenarioBuilder<T>, string, Action<T>)`.\n\nThe simplest pattern:\n```csharp\nusing LightBDD.Framework;\nusing LightBDD.Framework.Scenarios;\nusing LightBDD.XUnit2;\n\n[FeatureDescription(\"Match Queries\")]\npublic class MatchQueryTests : FeatureFixture\n{\n    [Scenario]\n    public void Find_matches_between_two_teams()\n    {\n        Runner.RunScenario(\n            _ => Given_the_match_data_is_loaded(),\n            _ => When_I_search_for_matches_between(\"Flamengo\", \"Fluminense\"),\n            _ => Then_I_should_receive_a_list_of_matches());\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWait, `RunScenario` takes params of `Action`? Let me check `BasicExtensions.RunScenario`. Let me check signature.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecc6c3ee0016yVwXaBucRPE22","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecc698f4001WQYdktmv7Hhww2"}}
