7e3d99e40/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/StatisticsTests.cs\n===================================================================\n--- /private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/StatisticsTests.cs\n+++ /private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-1zdmpvud/retort-f437e3d99e40/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/StatisticsTests.cs\n@@ -50,9 +50,9 @@\n private void When_I_request_the_win_rate_breakdown_for_Brasileirao()\n     => ResultRates = Query.WinRateBreakdown(Competition.Brasileirao);\n \n private void When_I_request_the_top_5_biggest_victories()\n-    => ResultMatches = Query.BiggestWins(Competition.Other, top: 5);\n+    => ResultMatches = Query.BiggestWins(top: 5);\n \n private void Then_the_average_should_be_between_1_and_6()\n     => Assert.InRange(ResultDouble, 1.0, 6.0);\n \n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/StatisticsTests.cs","time":{"start":1782089053706,"end":1782089053707}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"For biggest victories I used Competition.Other (BR-Football dataset which has many tournaments). But BR-Football is 2023+ only and \"Other\" includes many tournaments. The biggest wins might be small. Actually the spec example mentions \"Santos 8-0 Bolivar (Libertadores)\". Let me check that the Libertadores data has big wins. Actually biggest wins across all data — let me not filter by competition, use null. But then top 5 might include historical huge wins. Let me just use no filter (null) for biggest victories to get genuinely biggest. Let me change to `Query.BiggestWins(top: 5)` (no competition filter).\n\nActually the test just checks ranking by goal difference, not a specific match. Any competition works. But to ensure 5 matches exist with goal differences, null filter is safest. Let me change.\n\nAlso for the win-rate breakdown summing to 1: floating point, fine.\n\nLet me also add a normalization/data-quality test file: team name variations, date formats, UTF-8, all 6 CSVs loadable.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecc8f35a001DTIgbIvy09qQ71","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecc8e325001A6f5lG9E1ftVdD"}}
