vals by checking known rival base pairs including \"atletico mineiro\".\n\nActually, even simpler and more robust: change the test to assert that each returned match's (home base, away base) is one of a known set OR just assert non-empty and that the count is reasonable. But the spec wants verification. Let me expand the test's derby set to include the \"Atletico Mineiro\" spelling. Let me add (cruzeiro, atletico mineiro) and (atletico mineiro, cruzeiro).\n\nLet me see the other 2 failures. Let me run with more detail.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecc9aea5001WLX8fc7zfgzuT2","sessionID":"ses_11343aad7ffeUJRsKWvvH5xMok","messageID":"msg_eecc976ee0010Ug3CU2xQWUMCI"}}
